            <fr:title text="November/December 2025">November/December 2025</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Log</fr:taxon>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>
    I joined the <fr:link href="/dhsorens-ef/" title="Ethereum Foundation" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-ef/" display-uri="dhsorens-ef" type="local">EF</fr:link> in November 2025 with a week at Devconnect.
    My first projects will focus on stress-testing formal verification tools, including <fr:link href="http://hax.cryspen.com/" type="external">Hax</fr:link> and <fr:link href="https://github.com/Verified-zkEVM/ArkLib/" type="external">Arklib</fr:link> to start.
</html:p>
          </fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
